Z||000000||Haze_Performance||09-04-2000||08:59 AM||||Well Spryo (forum member) was driving around his neighborhood that he has lived in for 25 years yesterday, and he saw a clean 86SE parked in a driveway around the corner by his house (I dont know how he missed it before?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ). Well he stoped and droped off some Forum & Club info on the window. Well the guy called him back and told him that he was a club member (has been for 2 years) and in 1999 he was the one that won the raffle at Fierorama. (A red 87 GT I think.Both of his cars have 45,000 on them. The Red one gets stored in the garage.) Spryo said he was a real nice guy & He's going to check out the Forum. Hey Oreif do you know him??<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycarsig.jpg">   <B>1985 Sport Coupe </B><P><BR><B>Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A></B>||||reg||4
Z||000001||Oreif||09-04-2000||08:17 PM||||I met him at Fierorama last year and I think he was up at the club meeting at Archie's in March. Don't know him personally. Just met him the one time. <P>Haze, <BR>Coyote is bringing his car to the Fierorama. His interior is all done and the stereo system is sounding Excellent! You can see how he did the 10" sub behind the seat. His Interior is almost all Mr.Mikes.||||reg||1
